  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KIR F&#xE4;ngelsereform</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KYR Prison reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kriminalv&#xE5;rden (the Swedish Prison and Probation Service - SPPS) har inkommit med en &#xF6;nskan om att Sida skall st&#xF6;dja ett fyra&#xE5;rigt projekt g&#xE4;llande bilateralt samarbete mellan kriminalv&#xE5;rden i Kirgizistan och i Sverige. Den verkst&#xE4;llande parten &#xE4;r Kriminalv&#xE5;rden i Sverige.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to bring the Kyrgyz Prison Administration in conformity with international standards. Training of different categories of staff will help to develop new methods for social work with the inmates and preparation for release. Training and study tours to Sweden will be used to create a new set of values in conformity with international standards.</narrative>
  </description>
